Accessing the Name of a Sublist with a Method
To open the sublist, which is contained in a cell of type Stack, Queue, List, and Table, hold down Shift
and double-click into the cell.
Instead, you can also right-click the cell and select Open Object or click in the text box, and press F2.
Use the attribute Name to access the name of the sublist via information flow.
Example
var str: string
str := .Models.MyPlantAnytown.SteeringTypes["Jacks","9149"].Name 
// returns the value of the cell that contains the subtable, 4 in the 
example 
See also
Creating Lists within Lists and Tables
